  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3be3048eed6de9b48a1a9ab3da6b5b67, type: 3}
  m_Name: DragonbornExemplar
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Eldoria::Eldoria.Units.UnitTemplate
  displayName: Dragonborn Exemplar
  role: 1
  description: 'The Dragonborn who lead the Empire''s warriors in battle. The Exemplar
    has a Dragonborn Footman''s armor, accuracy and move but twice the health (20
    health, Armor Level 2, 75% accuracy, 10 m a move). It carries a Raptor Pistol
    (4 damage, penetration 1, 20 m) and, for when an enemy comes within 2 m, a Ceremonial
    Blade (5 damage, penetration 1, melee). Its Empowering Presence gives other friendly
    soldiers within 15 m +2 damage with their weapons, so keep it close to your Dragonborn
    and Kobolds. As a Solo unit it''s a prime target. A Commander: every army needs
    exactly one.'
  leader: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0de00d62151d6c64188a93186a2431d7, type: 2}
